fact('Target all18 metadata','All18 complete registrations read. Defaults nameUnnamed,num_targets0,targets_foe/targets_all/affects_foe_side/long_range false. User and None remain0 metadata, not a failure claim. NearAlly/UserOrNearAlly one/nonfoe; NearFoe/RandomNearFoe/NearOther one/foe; Foe and Other additionally long_range. AllAllies2+targets_all+long_range; UserAndAllies2+long_range. AllNearFoes/AllNearOthers2+foe; AllFoes2+foe+long_range; AllBattlers2+foe+targets_all+long_range. FoeSide affects_foe_side only. can_choose_distant_target requires exactly1 and long_range; can_target_one_foe exactly1 and targets_foe. Actual target selection is a separate battle consumer.','Data/Scripts/010_Data/001_Hardcoded data/017_Target.rb',[1,185],['generic-kernel/wp03-content-identity-and-schema.md field responsibility'])
fact('Mega target and identity','getMegaForm scans Species iteration order and requires base species exact and unmega_form==form_simple. Matching stone OR known move selects first matching entry then breaks; no target0. hasMegaForm requires >0 and differs current simple form. mega? instead tests current resolved species_data mega_stone or mega_move, independent of still holding/knowing it. getUnmegaForm returns current unmega_form only when mega? else-1. No ring/PP/battle quota/Shadow gate in these individual methods.',mega,[6,32],['pokemon-rules/wp22-mega-and-primal-reversion.md §3 M01–M03'])
fact('Mega writes and labels','makeMega writes form only target>0; makeUnmega only target>=0. These use Pokemon.form= and do not clear forced_form. megaName uses nonempty current form_name else Mega plus species_data.name; megaMessage recomputes available target and returns target record message or0. No ring/item/PP consumption occurs in this unit.',mega,[34,54],['pokemon-rules/wp22-mega-and-primal-reversion.md §3 M02–M03'])
fact('Primal nil versus stored identity','hasPrimalForm accepts every nonnil callback result including0; primal? requires nonnil result==stored @form, not forced simple result. makePrimal commits any nonnil result. makeUnprimal prefers any nonnil getUnprimalForm result, else commits0 only if current primal? true. Default only GROUDON REDORB→1/KYOGRE BLUEORB→1, no getUnprimalForm registered; removing orb can leave stored1 without primal? or automatic naked unmake.',mega,[60,82],['pokemon-rules/wp22-mega-and-primal-reversion.md §5'],['Fixed source; default MultipleForms GROUDON/KYOGRE entries164–176 own full read; hasItem? registry and form= consumer own full read.'])
fact('Battle Mega permission and state','Ring lookup uses current player bag for pbOwnedByPlayer, otherwise actual owner item list; no list false. Permission checks switch34, battler.hasMega?, wild first; then DEBUG+CTRL straight through before SkyDrop/ring/quota. Normal quota requires side/owner value-1. Naked register writes index; unregister only matching index→-1; toggle matching→-1 else replace; no permission recheck.',ac,[67,130],['pokemon-rules/wp22-mega-and-primal-reversion.md §4.1–4.2'])
fact('Mega execution ordered prefix','Executor checks battler/pokemon and hasMega?/notmega first, then increments player-owned count, stores old ability, optional Illusion trigger, message/animation, Pokemon.makeMega, battler.form= (writes Pokemon again), pbUpdate(true), scene change/refresh/animation/message, owner quota-2, Mega Gengar Telekinesis0, lost/gained ability hooks, optional priority recalculation. Does not recheck ring/switch/quota/registration. Exceptions retain earlier prefix; no compensation here.',ac,[135,175],['pokemon-rules/wp22-mega-and-primal-reversion.md §4.3'],['Fixed source. Battler.hasMega? blocks Transform at145–148; form setter67–70 and pbUpdate285–303 actual complete contained methods read. Broader menu/normal caller and ability-hook effects remain separate OPEN unless received.'])
fact('Primal executor limited guards','Executor rejects missing battler/pokemon/fainted, then hasPrimal? or alreadyprimal; Battler.hasPrimal? separately blocks Transform. Pre/post animation only KYOGRE/GROUDON; makePrimal→battler.form=→pbUpdate(true)→scene change/refresh→message. No ring/quota/statistics/priority-recompute or Mega gained/lost hooks in this method. Normal switch-in ability consumers remain separate.',ac,[180,200],['pokemon-rules/wp22-mega-and-primal-reversion.md §5 P02–P03'])
fact('Egg generation normalization and channels','generate swaps roles once iff mother.male? OR father.female? OR mother.genderless?, no recheck. Ditto roles from current species egg_groups. Species parent mother unless mother Ditto. Each parent breeding_can_produce?(baby) flags computed, then basic egg→form→nature→ability→moves→IV→ball→shininess→pokerus→calc_stats→return notinparty. Input reads may cache/commit via Pokemon getters; no compatibility gate in generate.',dc,[21,50],['pokemon-rules/wp34-inheritance-and-offspring.md §3/§9'])
fact('Egg species and basic defaults','determine uses Species.get(parent).get_baby_species(true,mother.item_id,father.item_id), then result Species.offspring.sample only if nonempty, preserves duplicate weighting. Basic Pokemon.new(species,EGG_LEVEL) default moves, nameEgg, hatch_steps from species, obtain_text Day-Care Couple,happiness120,SINISTEA form0, then getFormOnEggCreation and commit if truthy (Ruby0 truthy). No party insertion.',dc,[53,73],['pokemon-rules/wp34-inheritance-and-offspring.md §4/§5.1'])
fact('Inherited form submissions','First species_parent InheritFormFromMother→egg.form=parent.form; then [mother,father] first in_family+InheritFormWithEverStone+EVERSTONE assigns and breaks. Same numeric value still invokes form=; form/caches writes precede onSetForm/stats/dex and exception keeps prefix. collect_egg generates before checking party_full, so capacity rejection does not undo earlier same-value egg registration.',dc,[76,91],['pokemon-rules/wp34-inheritance-and-offspring.md §5.2'],['Own Pokemon.form= and Pokedex.register complete sources; collect_egg491–498 actual source lines to be checked in identity ledger, method body actually read. No host execution.'])
fact('Inherited move list channels','If father role Ditto, move_father=mother object,move_mother=father object; otherwise respective roles. Shared level list requires level>egg.level and both know. Optional machine channel traverses Item registry order, nonfemale move_father, known/compatible. Father eggmoves nonfemale; optional mother eggmoves female. EggMoves is raw current species list here, not get_egg_moves fallback. PICHU/VOLTTACKLE existence plus either in_family parent LIGHTBALL appends special. Combined candidate order retained.',dc,[94,134],['pokemon-rules/wp34-inheritance-and-offspring.md §6'])
fact('Move deduplication and nature','Inherited candidates reverse→union[]→reverse preserve last occurrence; learn last MAX_MOVES at most, with existing default moves still subject to individual learn_move. Nature candidates mother then father only EVERSTONE holders; empty no assignment, nonempty .sample preserves duplicate weights. Constructor calc_stats already fills nature cache; later personalID reassignment does not clear it.',dc,[137,158],['pokemon-rules/wp34-inheritance-and-offspring.md §5.3/§6.2'])
fact('Ability inheritance','Parent mother unless motherDitto thenfather. Hidden branch rand100<60 assigns parent ability_index else leaves current default/cache untouched; ordinary branch rand100<80 assigns parent index else (parent.index+1)%2. No separate generation gate in this function; source comments describe fixed Gen6+ model.',dc,[170,182],['pokemon-rules/wp34-inheritance-and-offspring.md §5.4'])
fact('IV inheritance','Stat.each_main order supplies pool;3 inherited, or5 for mechanics>=6 and either DESTINYKNOT. Power order WEIGHT/HP,BRACER/ATK,BELT/DEF,LENS/SPATK,BAND/SPDEF,ANKLET/SPEED. Each parent first matching held item contributes own iv value to that stat. Per stat samples supplied values, removes stat, decrements count once. Remaining pool.sample(count) without replacement, each chooses mother/father.sample.iv; remaining creation IV untouched.',dc,[184,212],['pokemon-rules/wp34-inheritance-and-offspring.md §7'])
fact('Ball and shiny inheritance','Ball candidates from in_family parents in role order, delete MASTERBALL/CHERISHBALL, sample only if nonempty. Shininess retries language mismatch father.owner vs mother.owner +6 gen>=8 else5, SHINYCHARM+2;0returns without cache access. Each round first egg.shiny? and break iftrue, else shiny=nil then new rand16|(rand16<<16). Last generated ID on exhaustion not read by loop and cache remainsnil; no other cache clear.',dc,[223,250],['pokemon-rules/wp34-inheritance-and-offspring.md §8.1–8.2'])
fact('DayCare slot/session consumers','Deposit writes slot pokemon, heal, SHAYMIN form0, initiallevel. add_exp returns empty/max;adds exp then only changed finallevel triggers calc_stats+learn every movelist entry exactly finallevel; no intermediary-level loop. generate_egg only count2, no compatibility or egg_generated guard. Sharing requires same species and free target slot; collects first known permitted get_egg_moves candidate per direction; if both choose one direction.sample. Every256steps chance [0,20,50,70] orOVAL[0,40,80,88],then optional50%sharing, then eachstep optionalExp. Default gen8 gain_expfalse/sharetrue.',dc,[260,405],['creature-rpg/wp30-growth-learning-and-friendship.md daycare consumer','pokemon-rules/wp34-inheritance-and-offspring.md fallback distinction'])
fact('DayCare compatibility and collection prefixes','Static deposit increments statistics before validating party index/full slots; successful slot heal/mutation before partydelete/reset. Withdraw validates filled andpartycapacity, adds levels statistic thenpush/reset/counters. collect_egg generate first, nil raise, capacity raise, push thenreset; no compatibility or availableflag recheck. compatibility count2, rejects Shadow andUndiscovered, accepts overlappinggroups orDitto, then oppositegender or exactlyoneDitto; base1 +samespecies +differentowner.id.',dc,[442,553],['pokemon-rules/wp34-inheritance-and-offspring.md §10','creature-rpg/wp35-eggs-and-hatching.md §7'])
fact('Hatching step snapshot timing','Handler walks current party index order; steps<=0 skip, decrement1, then dynamic player.pokemon_party (non-eggs at this time) scans ability FasterEggHatching, first flag decrement1/break. NoHPguard. If<=0 sets0 thenpbHatch synchronously before next member. Counter1 member can join own non-egg scan; earlier hatched flagged member accelerates later eggs; externalnegative staysnegative because skipped.',h,[250,268],['creature-rpg/wp35-eggs-and-hatching.md §4/§9'])
fact('Hatch core ordered writes','pbHatch noegg/alreadyhatched guard and no steps assignment. Stats.eggs_hatched first, speciesname query, name nil, Owner.new_from_trainer(player), happiness120,timeEggHatched Time.now.to_i,obtain_method1,hatched_map currentmap,record_first_moves, then animation. Prefix retained on later exception; direct repeated call repeats writes/statistics. Owner assignment does not clear existing shiny cache.',h,[212,225],['creature-rpg/wp35-eggs-and-hatching.md §5.1/§9'])
fact('Hatch scene and naming','Scene.start queries form/gender/shiny for egg bitmap andcracks. Scene main eventually sets Pokemon bitmap→metrics index1→cry→name nil→hatchedmessage→Pokedex register→owned→seenegg. Newentry gate setting&&!was_owned&&has_pokedex&&species_in_unlocked. Name inquiry onlygivenicknames0, min0maxMAX_NAME_SIZE initialempty, resultassigned; nicknamedtrue evenempty. End skips fade ifnicknamed then disposes. pbHatchAnimation always true makes fallback false branch unreachable without override.',h,[12,248],['creature-rpg/wp35-eggs-and-hatching.md §5.2–6'],['Hostgraphics/audio/nameinput not executed. Exact input control cancellation implementation remains separate UI dependency; finite source describes returned string handling only.'])
fact('Evolution scene submission','Cancelable animation BACK counts canceled and keeps species; no success branch. Success statistic first→targetcry/message→action_after_evolution (itemconsume/duplicate)→rememberfainted→species=→hp0iffainted→calc_stats→readyfalse→Pokedex register/owned→movelist entries level0 orcurrentlevel collected→optionalnewentry→pbLearnMove each. Failing later stage retains prefix. Duplicate clone new species,name nil,markings[],ballPOKEBALL,itemnil,ribbonsclear,calc/heal,partypush thenPokedexregister/owned. Resource/host behavior unexecuted.','Data/Scripts/016_UI/001_Non-interactive UI/004_UI_Evolution.rb',[1,276],['pokemon-rules/wp31-basic-evolution.md scene consumer','creature-rpg/wp30-growth-learning-and-friendship.md evolution learning'])
fact('Settings finite defaults','Actually read complete constant declarations: MECHANICS_GENERATION8;MAXIMUM_LEVEL100;EGG_LEVEL1;SHINY16;SUPER_SHINYtrue;legendary3perfectIVstrue;POKERUS3;DISABLE_IVS_AND_EVSfalse;relearner_moretrue;daycaregainExpfalse/sharemovestrue;inheritmachinesfalse/motherEggtrue;TAUGHT_MACHINES_KEEP_OLD_PPfalse. Derived declarations are evaluated configuration, not runtime toggles that recompute when another constant changes. BattleSettings full: Mega switch34/recalculationtrue,MOVE_CATEGORY_PER_MOVEtrue,AFFECTION_EFFECTSfalse/APPLY_HAPPINESS_SOFT_CAPfalse.','Data/Scripts/001_Settings.rb',[1,270],['generic-kernel/wp02-rule-configuration-and-data-variants.md','pokemon-rules/wp34-inheritance-and-offspring.md §11'],['Only actual source slices1–190 and230–270, plus fullBattleSettings1–140 receive credit; unshown191–229 and271+ OPEN. No entireSettings reading claim.'])
